flowchart LR
        OP["Developer / admin / Codex client<br/>operator credential"]:::client
        OC["OpenClaw controller plugin<br/>separate workload credential"]:::client
        PILOT["Local pilot / bounded executor<br/>work packet + actual checks"]:::local
        MCP["MCP gateway<br/>HTTP or STDIO · typed tools<br/>authentication + task scope"]:::service
        PDP["Cerbos<br/>trusted roles and resource policy"]:::gate
        SVC["Application service<br/>workflow · capture · validation<br/>publication · retrieval · metrics"]:::service
        ANALYZE["Deterministic code analyzer<br/>local gateway profile only"]:::service
        WORKER["Worker<br/>outbox · source checks<br/>retention alerts · trace export"]:::service
        PG[("PostgreSQL authority<br/>versions · decisions · workflow<br/>graphs · traces · outbox")]:::data
        CAS[("Local SHA-256 artifact store<br/>exact output · manifests · receipts")]:::evidence
        AGE[("Apache AGE projection<br/>active topology in PostgreSQL")]:::data
        MV[("Milvus Standalone<br/>derived semantic indexes<br/>etcd + MinIO dependencies")]:::data
        GIT[("Read-only Git source<br/>exact branch and revision<br/>code · policies · docs")]:::evidence
    OLLAMA["Ollama<br/>clients invoke local coding<br/>worker invokes embeddings"]:::local
    OTEL["Optional OTel collector<br/>Compose telemetry overlay<br/>actual collector tested in E2E"]:::target
    CLOUD["Conditional development review<br/>read-only Codex; Kimi advisory<br/>sanitized package + exact evidence"]:::target
    OP --> MCP
    OC --> MCP
    PILOT --> MCP
    MCP --> SVC
    SVC -->|authorize| PDP
    SVC -->|transaction| PG
    SVC -->|immutable bytes| CAS
    SVC --> ANALYZE --> GIT
    PG -->|durable work| WORKER
    WORKER -->|local embeddings| OLLAMA
    WORKER -->|project| MV
    WORKER -->|project| AGE
    WORKER -->|export when configured| OTEL
    SVC -->|discover IDs| MV
    SVC -->|bounded traversal| AGE
    OC -.->|only when policy allows| CLOUD
    CLOUD -.->|review artifacts through MCP| MCP
    NOTE["Every search hit is hydrated from PostgreSQL.<br/>Generated KB entries require explicit user publication.<br/>Maintenance stays local; no cloud fallback."]:::gate
    SVC -.- NOTE

